---
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<div class="steps">
  <div class="card tealbar"><h3>Sign up</h3><p>Create your free shop account with your email, shop name and website. No card needed.</p><p><a href={SITE.signup}>Start free</a></p></div>
  <div class="card tealbar"><h3>Set your prices</h3><p>Start from a starter price grid and change it to match how you already price jobs: colours, quantities, fees and minimums.</p></div>
  <div class="card tealbar"><h3>Put it on your site</h3><p>Paste one line of code into your website, or install the WordPress plugin. Style it to match your site's colours, font and corners.</p><p><a href="/for-shops">Install guide</a></p></div>
</div>
<ul class="promises"><li>No training</li><li>A flat monthly price</li><li>Export your data anytime</li></ul>
